  "details": "This one is in relation with my previous canny post:\n\ni would like to assign my own bindings for VRchat, currently these are hardcoded (wasd, R, V, X, Z,C. etc...), there's already an interface with all the bound keys available in-client, but we cannot change them, seems like half the work is done already ;)\n\nthis let's us choose our preferred binding (which may conflicts with other software), give everyone the opportunity to set something they would prefer, and give us the flexibility to map this with other software/controllers.\n\nexamples:\n\narrow keys for left-handed\n\nctrl+1-2-3 for camera pins\n\nexpressions could be rebinded to something more simple than Shift+Fkey\n\netc...\n\nother examples :\n\ni could map a midi controller, or a razor tartarus to change emotions\n\npress ctrl+M for toggling my personnal mirror.",
